  ('77777777-0000-0000-0000-000000000047', 1, 'Main', 'Explain the difference between a layered architecture and Clean Architecture.', 'A layered architecture has Presentation, Business and Data layers with dependencies flowing downward, so business logic usually depends on data access. Clean Architecture puts the Domain and use cases at the center; outer layers like the UI and the database are details that depend inward through interfaces. For example, the repository interface lives in Application and the EF Core implementation lives in Infrastructure.', 'audio/000015/q1-t1.webm', timestamptz '2026-09-15 10:30+07' + interval '30 seconds', timestamptz '2026-09-15 10:30+07' + interval '132 seconds'),
