  ('77777777-0000-0000-0000-000000000049', 1, 'Main', 'What are coupling and cohesion? Give an example of a highly cohesive design.', 'Coupling is classes depending on each other and should be low. Cohesion is a class doing one thing and should be high.', 'audio/000015/q3-t1.webm', timestamptz '2026-09-15 10:30+07' + interval '236 seconds', timestamptz '2026-09-15 10:30+07' + interval '286 seconds'),
  ('77777777-0000-0000-0000-000000000049', 2, 'FollowUp', 'Can you give a concrete example of high cohesion?', 'For example, an EmailSender class that only has methods for sending emails.', 'audio/000015/q3-t2.webm', timestamptz '2026-09-15 10:30+07' + interval '296 seconds', timestamptz '2026-09-15 10:30+07' + interval '388 seconds'),
  ('77777777-0000-0000-0000-000000000050', 1, 'Main', 'When should you use the Strategy pattern? Give an example.', 'When there are several interchangeable algorithms, for example several payment methods.', 'audio/000015/q4-t1.webm', timestamptz '2026-09-15 10:30+07' + interval '398 seconds', timestamptz '2026-09-15 10:30+07' + interval '459 seconds'),
  ('77777777-0000-0000-0000-000000000050', 2, 'FollowUp', 'How does Strategy help compared with writing if-else?', 'You can add a new option without changing existing code, which follows the open-closed principle.', 'audio/000015/q4-t2.webm', timestamptz '2026-09-15 10:30+07' + interval '469 seconds', timestamptz '2026-09-15 10:30+07' + interval '552 seconds'),
